NOTE ON UNDERLYING DATA
-----------------------
This licence covers the analysis, presentation and derived figures produced by
this study. It does not and cannot relicense the third-party source material on
which the study draws — including but not limited to publications by DESNZ,
Ofgem, NESO, HMRC, HM Treasury, Elexon, Eurostat, BNetzA, Destatis, the NDRC,
the National Bureau of Statistics of China, the IAEA and the NSTA. Each source
is individually cited with its URL and retrieval date in the `sources` sheet of
the master workbook and remains subject to its own terms of use.

